Resources/english-words.txt is a filtered list of alphabetic headwords from
Webster's Second International (1934), as shipped by macOS in
/usr/share/dict/web2. That word list is in the public domain; the 1934
copyright has lapsed. See /usr/share/dict/README on macOS.

Resources/english-extra.txt and Resources/korean-words.txt are original
compilations written for this project.

Resources/korean-valid.txt is a Hangul word list derived from
open-korean-text (https://github.com/open-korean-text/open-korean-text).
Copyright 2014 Twitter, Inc. and the open-korean-text contributors.
That file is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, not the MIT
license above. See Resources/korean-valid.LICENSE.
